  OnError Goto HandleError

  Dialog
    Title GetResString(IDS_ABOUT) + " " + GetResString(IDS_APP_DESCRIPTION) + " (" + GetResString(IDS_VERSION)+ " " + AppVersion + ")"

    Control StaticText Title GetResString(IDS_ABOUT_1) Position 10, 10
